(6686684, 997778, 67258, '<td valign="top">Ha, amusing to see the cultural reactions to this!  In the UK the back of hand V symbol has a quite different meaning to victory, and especially to peace!  The processing style really suited my perceived take on the meaning of the image - a very in your face, British, two-fingers up at the world!  One of my highest scores of the challenge.<br/> <br/>Edit - I don''t think I have ever seen scores so evenly spread across the range!<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-02-22 00:25:04.</i></td>', 'Ha, amusing to see the cultural reactions to this!  In the UK the back of hand V symbol has a quite different meaning to victory, and especially to peace!  The processing style really suited my perceived take on the meaning of the image - a very in your face, British, two-fingers up at the world!  One of my highest scores of the challenge. Edit - I don''t think I have ever seen scores so evenly spread across the range!', '2012-02-22 00:23:44.000000', '2012-02-22 00:25:04.000000', 0),
