(6686725, 997785, 30364, '<td valign="top">This may be your crowning achievement!  ''Z'' is the final letter, the ''brown'' in the alphabet itself, and yet the depicted  Z is manifest only <i>after</i> the challenge is complete.  It''s obvious now  you really can''t miss seeing it  but it was very cleverly concealed during voting.  One of those ''hiding in plain sight'' things.<br/> <br/>You are a little out of reach for most folks here, which is a measure of their limitations and not your own.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This may be your crowning achievement!  ''Z'' is the final letter, the ''brown'' in the alphabet itself, and yet the depicted  Z is manifest only after the challenge is complete.  It''s obvious now  you really can''t miss seeing it  but it was very cleverly concealed during voting.  One of those ''hiding in plain sight'' things. You are a little out of reach for most folks here, which is a measure of their limitations and not your own. ', '2012-02-22 00:46:28.000000', NULL, 0),
