(6687104, 997785, 69325, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jagar:</b></div><hr/><i> The narrow-mindedness of this place will never cease to amaze me, perhaps it''s time I took a break. Brave image, well done. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>well obviously any viewpoint that doesn''t coincide with yours is narrow-minded, I feel silly now.<br/> <br/>Oh wait, maybe it''s the fact that he has done this (or something very similar) 28 times previously and this is at least the 4th white one by my observation.</td>', 'Originally posted by jagar: The narrow-mindedness of this place will never cease to amaze me, perhaps it''s time I took a break. Brave image, well done.   well obviously any viewpoint that doesn''t coincide with yours is narrow-minded, I feel silly now. Oh wait, maybe it''s the fact that he has done this (or something very similar) 28 times previously and this is at least the 4th white one by my observation.', '2012-02-22 10:00:44.000000', NULL, 0),
